    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Unnatural Beauties, you will have to capture animals, splice them together, and enter them into beauty pageants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start the game in your garden, this is where a variety of creatures live. Using only your cardboard box and fishing gnome, it's time to catch as many animals as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are done hunting, head to your lab; this is where you will create your pageant contender. Using the animals you captured, pick the best parts of each creature and combine them to form a potential winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's time to enter a contender into a pageant. Pageants take the form of mini games which test your contender's different qualities; looks, smarts, strength, and swimming ability. Each body part of your contender has different stats across these areas, tailoring your creation to the different pageants will make the mini games easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placing in the top three will unlock the next pageant and give you a cash reward. Cash can be spend in the shop to unlock other methods of catching creatures and to encourage a wider variety of animals to enter your garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep catching creatures, create more contenders, and try to win every pageant to become the world's best beauty queen creator!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Unnatural Beauties, you will have to capture animals, splice them together, and enter them into beauty pageants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start the game in your garden, this is where a variety of creatures live. Using only your cardboard box and fishing gnome, it's time to catch as many animals as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you are done hunting, head to your lab; this is where you will create your pageant contender. Using the animals you captured, pick the best parts of each creature and combine them to form a potential winner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's time to enter a contender into a pageant. Pageants take the form of mini games which test your contender's different qualities; looks, smarts, strength, and swimming ability. Each body part of your contender has different stats across these areas, tailoring your creation to the different pageants will make the mini games easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Placing in the top three will unlock the next pageant and give you a cash reward. Cash can be spend in the shop to unlock other methods of catching creatures and to encourage a wider variety of animals to enter your garden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep catching creatures, create more contenders, and try to win every pageant to become the world's best beauty queen creator!</p>",
